sequenceDiagram
    actor User as المستخدم
    participant UI as React Shell
    participant Slice as Submit Slice
    participant WR as WorkRecords
    participant Auth as Authorization
    participant Wf as Workflow
    participant Org as Organization
    participant Audit as Audit
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox

    User->>UI: إرسال سجل عمل
    UI->>Slice: SubmitWorkRecord command
    Slice->>WR: dispatch handler (transaction owner)
    WR->>Auth: DecideAccess(submit, RecordFacts)
    Auth-->>WR: Allow with scope
    WR->>Wf: StartWorkflow(publishedVersionId)
    Wf->>Wf: Pin workflow_version_id on instance
    Wf->>Org: ResolveApprover(currentStep)
    Org-->>Wf: Approver identity
    Wf-->>WR: Workflow instance id
    WR->>WR: persist state + outbox in one transaction
    WR->>Audit: Append critical audit when required
    WR->>Outbox: WorkRecordSubmitted event
    WR-->>Slice: Submitted response after commit
    Slice-->>UI: 200 OK
    UI-->>User: تأكيد الإرسال

    Note over Wf,WR: العقد المتزامن ينضم إلى معاملة WorkRecords ولا ينفذ commit<br/>النشر الجديد لمسار لا يغير المعاملات الجارية بصمت
